 "text": "Skip to Main Content\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205\n\nAbout Us\nContact\nFAQ's\nYour Trip\nTravel Info\nBlog\nMeet The Team\n\nHome\n\nMeet our Team\n\nMeet Our Team! We're proud to introduce you to the passionate individuals behind Mazingira Safaris. Each of our team members brings a unique set of skills and experiences, united by a shared love for Tanzania's natural beauty and wildlife. From seasoned guides with deep knowledge of the terrain to enthusiastic support staff who ensure your trip runs smoothly, our team is dedicated to providing you with an unforgettable safari experience. Get to know the faces that will be guiding you on your adventure, sharing stories, and making sure every detail of your journey is perfect. Join us on a safari adventure where our team makes all the difference!\n\n​\n\nCLICK OUR TEAM PICTURES TO GET TO KNOW MORE ABOUT US\n\nJacob. S Kereiya\n\nCEO/Founder , Tour Consultant\n\nShiisa Ayo\n\nSales , Tour Consultant\n\nCassie Jennings\n\nUk Sales Manager , Tour Consultant\n\nDavid Raston\n\nSafari Tour Guide\n\nGoodluck Nathan\n\nSafari Tour Guide\n\nTumsifu (Thom)\n\nSafari Tour Guide\n\nAdam Nkinde\n\nSafari Tour Guide\n\nDaniel Fredrick\n\nSafari Tour Guide\n\nLeonard Eddie Belle \n\nSafari Tour Guide \n\nSimon C. Simon\n\nSafari Tour Guide\n\nSolomon Akyoo (Daniel)\n\nSafari Tour Guide\n\nLucas\n\nSafari Tour Guide \n\nAnna Abraham\n\nAccountant\n\nWidget Didn’t Load\nCheck your internet and refresh this page.\nIf that doesn’t work, contact us.\nRefresh this page\nContact us\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\nuk.sales@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205 / +255767278204\n\nAccessibility Statement \n\nMazingira Eco Friendly Safari Adventure\n\nArusha \n\nP.O Box 12544\n\nStay informed, join our newsletter\n\nEnter your email here \nSubscribe\n\nMazingira Safari © 2023 | ",
